Subject: [LOCAL] softisp: preserve CFA while reducing full IMX363 preview

Average 16 same-colour linear RAW10 samples before normal libcamera processing.
Opt-in and restricted to the measured full sensor mode and small previews.
Still captures use the unchanged full-resolution path.

